  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 10316931072
    m_Localized: "A cosmic cataclysm has devastated Earth, rendering it a ghostly
      and uninhabitable wasteland. The sky is a grim shroud lashed by frenzied winds;
      the oceans have given way to a dense, crimson substance.\n\r\nIn a desperate
      attempt to understand the plague, a scientific expedition managed to locate
      the source basin, building drainage stations to pump out the fluid and unearth
      the secrets of the seabed.\n\r\nBut human intervention has awakened something
      that should have remained buried, and the situation has spiraled out of control.
      The only hope left is to venture into the desolate canyons and shut down all
      the stations before the horror becomes absolute.\n\nTo do this, you will have
      to fly an old service hot-air balloon... this is your mission. \n\nGood luck.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
